      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>PR: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/718\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/718</a></p>\n\n<p>Changes made to address 2 design choices:</p>\n\n<p>(1) public static utility classes should not abstract:</p>\n\n<p>org.fcrepo.kernel.utils.NamespaceTools <br/>\n src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/utils/ContentDigest.java<br/>\norg.fcrepo.kernel.services.functions.JcrPropertyFunctions</p>\n\n<p>(2) classes should not be abstract when no implementation is given:</p>\n\n<p>src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/impl/services/AbstractService.java<br/>\nsrc/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/impl/services/ServiceHelpers.java<br/>\nsrc/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/commons/AbstractResource.java</p>",
     "created": "13/Feb/15 1:21 PM",
